# k.faces/shards/miniavs-slots: the slots of the DiceBear style `miniavs`: the box that the variants of each slot fill in the 0 to 100 frame of the face, and the draw order.
# sources: dicebear-miniavs 67f54a0 (DiceBear style "miniavs", CC BY 4.0: Remix of "Miniavs - Free Avatar Creator" (https://www.figma.com/community/file/923211396597067458) by "Webpixels", licensed under "CC BY 4.0" (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/))
